TWEAK_NAME="Enable Wi-Fi client"
TWEAK_RISK="high"
TWEAK_EXPERIMENTAL=1
TWEAK_DESCRIPTION="Installs a boot runtime that stops the stock access-point processes, starts wpa_supplicant in client mode and requests an address over DHCP or applies a static one. Requires OPENCMU_WIFI_SSID and OPENCMU_WIFI_PSK; the PSK and SSID are stored in /data/opencmu/config/wifi-client.conf with mode 600. Requires 60-startup-hook and starts at the next boot. Rollback stops the client but does not restart the access point; reboot for that."
